# Public configuration only. No seeds, passwords or API secrets here.
# / uses mainnet-v2: https://solana-rpc.publicnode.com (genesis verified).
# /devnet uses legacy devnet-v1: https://api.devnet.solana.com.
# Each endpoint is fixed to its authorization profile and genesis-verified.
# No RPC override / network environment toggle is accepted.
# Separate public/mainnet-deployment.json and public/deployment.json pin deployments.
# Mainnet requires immutable bytecode + exact-build review + finalized lifecycle proof.
# Token CA is public metadata (public/token.json), independent of vault authorization.
